                                            &lt;img src=&quot;https://images-news.now.com/newsimage/NewsImage/2025-09-30-18-54-50XlVeRgG5.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;中秋節2025｜全港7大賞月好去處　大坑舞火龍／啟德發光玉兔／My Melody x Kuromi嘉年華&quot; data-description=&quot;中秋節2025｜全港7大賞月好去處　大坑舞火龍／啟德發光玉兔／My Melody x Kuromi嘉年華&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer&quot;&gt;
